00:28:59.319 --> 00:29:04.520
We're no longer going to be under the political dominion of a foreign power.

00:29:06.280 --> 00:29:11.560
En ben zema hazeh, Imot ha-Mashiah, ela sha'on machiyot velbat.

00:29:12.439 --> 00:29:13.079
Yes?

00:29:13.079 --> 00:29:15.640
In other words, the sole purpose of the Mashiah,

00:29:16.599 --> 00:29:22.599
and Chosmike, Rabbi Lubavitch, which I respect him, because they're doing a lot, a lot of good

00:29:22.599 --> 00:29:24.119
