01:02:52.600 --> 01:02:54.600
very difficult

01:02:54.600 --> 01:02:56.600
relationship with other human beings.

01:02:56.600 --> 01:02:58.600
Very difficult.

01:02:58.600 --> 01:03:00.600
Because you know the truth.

01:03:00.600 --> 01:03:02.600
You know the absolute truth.

01:03:02.600 --> 01:03:04.600
And because you know

01:03:04.600 --> 01:03:06.600
the absolute truth,

01:03:06.600 --> 01:03:08.600
this person doesn't know.

01:03:08.600 --> 01:03:10.600
So, it is very

01:03:10.600 --> 01:03:12.600
important that we don't

01:03:12.600 --> 01:03:14.600
project.

01:03:14.600 --> 01:03:16.600
The greatest Jew

01:03:16.600 --> 01:03:18.600
and the greatest human for us is

01:03:18.600 --> 01:03:20.600
Jesus knew it all.

01:03:20.600 --> 01:03:22.600
He was

01:03:22.600 --> 01:03:24.600
sitting at God's right hand.

01:03:24.600 --> 01:03:26.600
He said, he knows everything.

01:03:26.600 --> 01:03:28.600
He knows everything.

01:03:28.600 --> 01:03:30.600
There is nothing he doesn't know.

01:03:30.600 --> 01:03:32.600
Alright.

01:03:32.600 --> 01:03:34.600
And

01:03:34.600 --> 01:03:36.600
Moshe Rabbenu is different.

01:03:36.600 --> 01:03:38.600
Now, on the

01:03:38.600 --> 01:03:40.600
unpragmatic grounds,

01:03:40.600 --> 01:03:42.600
I am just saying, the worst thing is that you know what

01:03:42.600 --> 01:03:44.600
Allah is and you know what Allah is saying.

01:03:44.600 --> 01:03:46.600
Humility and so on.

01:03:46.600 --> 01:03:48.600
We don't know.

01:03:48.600 --> 01:03:50.600
So, how come all these derashur?

01:03:50.600 --> 01:03:52.600
They are all projections.

01:03:52.600 --> 01:03:54.600
They are all projections.

01:03:54.600 --> 01:03:56.600
And it is haram.

01:03:56.600 --> 01:03:58.600
It is haram.

01:04:00.600 --> 01:04:02.600
That is another way,

01:04:02.600 --> 01:04:04.600
a psychological way of making idols.

01:04:04.600 --> 01:04:06.600
You are

01:04:06.600 --> 01:04:08.600
worshipping your own projections.

01:04:08.600 --> 01:04:10.600
That is

01:04:10.600 --> 01:04:12.600
my understanding

01:04:12.600 --> 01:04:14.600
of the Tora. That is the way I follow

01:04:15.600 --> 01:04:17.600
Nobody could know.

01:04:17.600 --> 01:04:19.600
Nobody knows.

01:04:19.600 --> 01:04:21.600
I was arguing, there is of course genuine qabbala

01:04:21.600 --> 01:04:23.600
and there is non-qabbala.

01:04:23.600 --> 01:04:25.600
And

01:04:28.600 --> 01:04:30.600
a few years ago,

01:04:30.600 --> 01:04:32.600
you know the Bittachnessit in Haifa

01:04:32.600 --> 01:04:34.600
that I always pray, the son of the

01:04:34.600 --> 01:04:36.600
Hazzan.

01:04:36.600 --> 01:04:38.600
And I realize Hazzan, all time

01:04:38.600 --> 01:04:40.600
Hazzan, very nice guy.

01:04:40.600 --> 01:04:42.600
His son went two years in

01:04:42.600 --> 01:04:44.600
after two years he became Rosh Hashiva.

01:04:48.600 --> 01:04:50.600
Now he knew me since he was a little child.

01:04:50.600 --> 01:04:52.600
Now he is tall, mashallah.

01:04:52.600 --> 01:04:54.600
Two years, you know

01:04:54.600 --> 01:04:56.600
correspondent course.

01:04:58.600 --> 01:05:00.600
So,

01:05:00.600 --> 01:05:02.600
he wanted to talk to me and I felt

01:05:02.600 --> 01:05:04.600
that the reason he wanted to talk to me is to

01:05:04.600 --> 01:05:06.600
be a little bit insulting.

01:05:06.600 --> 01:05:08.600
An insulting man, I wanted to show that.

01:05:08.600 --> 01:05:10.600
I mean,

01:05:10.600 --> 01:05:12.600
I have nothing,

01:05:12.600 --> 01:05:14.600
he is a nice boy.

01:05:14.600 --> 01:05:16.600
So, he wanted to

01:05:16.600 --> 01:05:18.600
ask me something about qabbala or something like this.

01:05:18.600 --> 01:05:20.600
And I deliberately

01:05:20.600 --> 01:05:22.600
didn't want to get involved with him on this

01:05:22.600 --> 01:05:24.600
point.

01:05:24.600 --> 01:05:26.600
And I said,

01:05:26.600 --> 01:05:28.600
I said,

01:05:28.600 --> 01:05:30.600
what difference does it make?

01:05:30.600 --> 01:05:32.600
Why is it important

01:05:32.600 --> 01:05:34.600
now, in this stage

01:05:34.600 --> 01:05:36.600
in our earthly life

01:05:36.600 --> 01:05:38.600
to determine this kind of thing?

01:05:38.600 --> 01:05:40.600
He says,

01:05:40.600 --> 01:05:42.600
let God know, this is something

01:05:42.600 --> 01:05:44.600
only for God to know.

01:05:44.600 --> 01:05:46.600
I have to know the halakhot, the shuharut,

01:05:46.600 --> 01:05:48.600
the temarah, the tur,

01:05:48.600 --> 01:05:50.600
bet yosef,

01:05:50.600 --> 01:05:52.600
you know.

01:05:52.600 --> 01:05:54.600
What is it important for us to know

01:05:54.600 --> 01:05:56.600
whether he is right or the other guy is right?

01:05:56.600 --> 01:05:58.600
Let it be what it be.

01:05:58.600 --> 01:06:00.600
I tell Hazzan, I have no curiosity about it.

01:06:00.600 --> 01:06:02.600
Why?

01:06:02.600 --> 01:06:04.600
Because the haqqamin say that I have

01:06:04.600 --> 01:06:06.600
no capacity to understand this.

01:06:10.600 --> 01:06:12.600
I have no interest, no curiosity.

01:06:12.600 --> 01:06:14.600
If you want to tell it to me, I don't want to know it.

01:06:14.600 --> 01:06:16.600
Why?

01:06:16.600 --> 01:06:18.600
Mukarji.

01:06:18.600 --> 01:06:20.600
I am not worthy of this.

01:06:20.600 --> 01:06:22.600
The Tora says I am not worthy.

01:06:26.600 --> 01:06:28.600
All those things about this and the other thing

01:06:28.600 --> 01:06:30.600
and the other thing.

01:06:30.600 --> 01:06:32.600
That's not the German qabbala.

01:06:34.600 --> 01:06:36.600
Because I think I cannot understand.

01:06:36.600 --> 01:06:38.600
There are some things I cannot understand.

01:06:38.600 --> 01:06:40.600
There is on this,

01:06:40.600 --> 01:06:42.600
even on

01:06:42.600 --> 01:06:44.600
which seems to be

01:06:44.600 --> 01:06:46.600
a very simple metaphor.

01:06:46.600 --> 01:06:48.600
I am Rabbi abu

01:06:48.600 --> 01:06:50.600
and this is Moses.

01:06:50.600 --> 01:06:52.600
So if Rabbi abu cannot understand it,

01:06:52.600 --> 01:06:54.600
I cannot understand it.

01:06:54.600 --> 01:06:56.600
Leave me alone.

01:06:56.600 --> 01:06:58.600
There is a very,

01:06:58.600 --> 01:07:00.600
we have to realize

01:07:00.600 --> 01:07:02.600
the Rambam says very very beautiful

01:07:02.600 --> 01:07:04.600
one of the verses

01:07:04.600 --> 01:07:06.600
the greatness of

01:07:06.600 --> 01:07:08.600
haqqamin is when he realizes

01:07:08.600 --> 01:07:10.600
the boundaries of his own knowledge.

01:07:10.600 --> 01:07:12.600
He says I can't.

01:07:12.600 --> 01:07:14.600
This is as much as I can know.

01:07:14.600 --> 01:07:16.600
I cannot know more than that.

01:07:16.600 --> 01:07:18.600
You have to realize the boundaries

01:07:18.600 --> 01:07:20.600
of his knowledge.

01:07:20.600 --> 01:07:22.600
And there are boundaries.

01:07:22.600 --> 01:07:24.600
Rambam says there are two kinds of

01:07:24.600 --> 01:07:26.600
boundaries and I believe it is correct.

01:07:26.600 --> 01:07:28.600
Some boundaries are relative.

01:07:28.600 --> 01:07:30.600
You can understand now because you are young.

01:07:30.600 --> 01:07:32.600
Or if you go to school

01:07:32.600 --> 01:07:34.600
you are going to understand it. Fine.

01:07:34.600 --> 01:07:36.600
And then there are absolute boundaries.

01:07:36.600 --> 01:07:38.600
Just things which are

01:07:38.600 --> 01:07:40.600
absolutely transcend

01:07:40.600 --> 01:07:42.600
our

01:07:42.600 --> 01:07:44.600
our mental, our human capacity.

01:07:44.600 --> 01:07:46.600
You know.

01:07:46.600 --> 01:07:48.600
This is very important.

01:07:48.600 --> 01:07:50.600
So here

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:52.600
is a very sane approach.

01:07:52.600 --> 01:07:54.600
You have to be

01:07:54.600 --> 01:07:56.600
for certain things

01:07:56.600 --> 01:07:58.600
you wait for God.

01:07:58.600 --> 01:08:00.600
I am not going to anticipate what God has for me.

01:08:00.600 --> 01:08:02.600
You see.

01:08:02.600 --> 01:08:04.600
And I believe it is a very

01:08:04.600 --> 01:08:06.600
sane, very, very thing.

01:08:06.600 --> 01:08:08.600
And again, when they tell me all about this

01:08:08.600 --> 01:08:10.600
and that, you know.

01:08:10.600 --> 01:08:12.600
Some rabbis of qabbala I respect.

01:08:12.600 --> 01:08:14.600
Some rabbis I don't respect.

01:08:14.600 --> 01:08:16.600
And for me

01:08:16.600 --> 01:08:18.600
the boundary is very simple.

01:08:18.600 --> 01:08:20.600
Those rabbis who think that they know everything

01:08:20.600 --> 01:08:22.600
what Rabbi Yoshua Amen Levi didn't know.

01:08:22.600 --> 01:08:24.600
You know.

01:08:24.600 --> 01:08:26.600
I am not too impressed.

01:08:26.600 --> 01:08:28.600
Do you know?

01:08:28.600 --> 01:08:30.600
Yes. You know.

01:08:30.600 --> 01:08:32.600
So I am not too impressed with these rabbis to be honest.

01:08:32.600 --> 01:08:34.600
But with the other ones who says no.

01:08:34.600 --> 01:08:36.600
That much I would say no.

01:08:36.600 --> 01:08:38.600
Because I cannot talk.

01:08:38.600 --> 01:08:40.600
I feel that I have something

01:08:40.600 --> 01:08:42.600
to learn from those people.

01:08:42.600 --> 01:08:44.600
You know.

01:08:44.600 --> 01:08:46.600
There are a lot of stories

01:08:46.600 --> 01:08:48.600
when people may die

01:08:48.600 --> 01:08:50.600
a minute or two

01:08:50.600 --> 01:08:52.600
and then they come back.

01:08:52.600 --> 01:08:54.600
That's right.

01:08:54.600 --> 01:08:56.600
So pay attention.

01:08:56.600 --> 01:08:58.600
I read some of the stories.

01:08:58.600 --> 01:09:00.600
There is a story

01:09:00.600 --> 01:09:02.600
by a wonderful, wonderful, wonderful

01:09:02.600 --> 01:09:04.600
Rabbi.

01:09:04.600 --> 01:09:06.600
I wish he would be 50 years younger.

01:09:06.600 --> 01:09:08.600
He is an old man.

01:09:08.600 --> 01:09:10.600
Not old man.

01:09:10.600 --> 01:09:12.600
This must be in his

01:09:12.600 --> 01:09:14.600
mid 70s.

01:09:14.600 --> 01:09:16.600
He is the chief Rabbi of Tel Aviv.

01:09:16.600 --> 01:09:18.600
He is the chief Rabbi of Tel Aviv.

01:09:18.600 --> 01:09:20.600
He is the Talmud of Haram of Ziyar.

01:09:20.600 --> 01:09:22.600
I met him once

01:09:22.600 --> 01:09:24.600
40 some years ago.

01:09:24.600 --> 01:09:26.600
We were together.

01:09:26.600 --> 01:09:28.600
When we were in the offices

01:09:28.600 --> 01:09:30.600
in Tel Aviv together.

01:09:30.600 --> 01:09:32.600
Yes. But first I met him in this country.

01:09:32.600 --> 01:09:34.600
About 45 years ago.

01:09:34.600 --> 01:09:36.600
He is married to

01:09:36.600 --> 01:09:38.600
he and Rabbi

01:09:38.600 --> 01:09:40.600
the one from Netanya.

01:09:40.600 --> 01:09:42.600
Rabbi Shusha

01:09:42.600 --> 01:09:44.600
are brothers-in-law.

01:09:44.600 --> 01:09:46.600
They are married to sisters.

01:09:46.600 --> 01:09:48.600
Very, very, very nice.

01:09:48.600 --> 01:09:50.600
Nice.

01:09:50.600 --> 01:09:52.600
Haval that he was not elected

01:09:52.600 --> 01:09:54.600
chief Rabbi of Israel. He should have been elected now.

01:09:54.600 --> 01:09:56.600
Chief Rabbi of Israel.

01:09:56.600 --> 01:09:58.600
But because of politics he was not elected.

01:09:58.600 --> 01:10:00.600
He is a pupil of Rabbi of Ziyar.

01:10:00.600 --> 01:10:02.600
Whereas the present

01:10:02.600 --> 01:10:04.600
chief Rabbi is a pupil of

01:10:04.600 --> 01:10:06.600
Allah himself. Politics.

01:10:06.600 --> 01:10:08.600
He has a teshuvot on

01:10:08.600 --> 01:10:10.600
this kind of experiences.

01:10:10.600 --> 01:10:12.600
And he compares this with the qabbala.

01:10:12.600 --> 01:10:14.600
Very, very nice teshuvot.

01:10:14.600 --> 01:10:16.600
Very, very nice.

01:10:16.600 --> 01:10:18.600
None of these things

01:10:18.600 --> 01:10:20.600
tell you what Olam Abba is.

01:10:20.600 --> 01:10:22.600
I read, not all of them,

01:10:22.600 --> 01:10:24.600
but some of those things.

01:10:24.600 --> 01:10:26.600
They tell you about the light that they see, the peace that they feel.

01:10:26.600 --> 01:10:28.600
None of them says, you know,

01:10:28.600 --> 01:10:30.600
I drank wine, or I had, I don't know,

01:10:30.600 --> 01:10:32.600
a fantasy with sexual relations

01:10:32.600 --> 01:10:34.600
like the Rashi Ga'in.

01:10:34.600 --> 01:10:36.600
All of them is about peace and the light

01:10:36.600 --> 01:10:38.600
and the tunnel

01:10:38.600 --> 01:10:40.600
and all these things.

01:10:40.600 --> 01:10:42.600
But they don't tell you exactly what is beyond the tunnel.

01:10:42.600 --> 01:10:44.600
None of them tells you.

01:10:44.600 --> 01:10:46.600
The shape of this, of that,

01:10:46.600 --> 01:10:48.600
fine.

01:10:48.600 --> 01:10:50.600
This is like a tunnel,

01:10:50.600 --> 01:10:52.600
you know,

01:10:52.600 --> 01:10:54.600
maybe it's the river

01:10:54.600 --> 01:10:56.600
that's coming from Gal'ayda.

01:10:56.600 --> 01:10:58.600
You know, who knows what it is. I don't know what it is.

01:10:58.600 --> 01:11:00.600
They do have some way of saying that they met Jesus

01:11:00.600 --> 01:11:02.600
and this and that.

01:11:02.600 --> 01:11:04.600
That's their perception.

01:11:04.600 --> 01:11:06.600
Perception.

01:11:06.600 --> 01:11:08.600
Fine, I don't know.

01:11:08.600 --> 01:11:10.600
But the question of the light and the tunnel,

01:11:10.600 --> 01:11:12.600
this is apparently, according to Rabbi Haim Alebi,

01:11:12.600 --> 01:11:14.600
it's a very old motif.

01:11:14.600 --> 01:11:16.600
It appears in

01:11:16.600 --> 01:11:18.600
Jewish writings and so on.

01:11:18.600 --> 01:11:20.600
Since I respect very much Rabbi Haim Alebi,

01:11:20.600 --> 01:11:22.600
I rely on his

01:11:22.600 --> 01:11:24.600
point and he says,

01:11:24.600 --> 01:11:26.600
here's the thing of the tunnel and so on,

01:11:26.600 --> 01:11:28.600
you know.

01:11:28.600 --> 01:11:30.600
There's an English book on the tunnel.

01:11:30.600 --> 01:11:32.600
What is it called? You don't remember?

01:11:32.600 --> 01:11:34.600
I have it.

01:11:34.600 --> 01:11:36.600
A lot of stories and everyone comes out.

01:11:36.600 --> 01:11:38.600
And all of them say the same thing.

01:11:38.600 --> 01:11:40.600
All of them say the same thing.

01:11:40.600 --> 01:11:42.600
But there is.

01:11:42.600 --> 01:11:44.600
But they don't tell you what it is.

01:11:44.600 --> 01:11:46.600
It's peace and so on.

01:11:46.600 --> 01:11:48.600
But they don't tell you.

01:11:48.600 --> 01:11:50.600
Nobody could describe to you.

01:11:50.600 --> 01:11:52.600
Nobody. No creature.

01:11:52.600 --> 01:11:54.600
No mundane creature

01:11:54.600 --> 01:11:56.600
could know what it is.

01:11:56.600 --> 01:11:58.600
But again, when you say peace,

01:11:58.600 --> 01:12:00.600
what do you mean? Relax.

01:12:00.600 --> 01:12:02.600
Don't tell me what it is.

01:12:02.600 --> 01:12:04.600
What is it not?

01:12:04.600 --> 01:12:06.600
You're not afraid. There's no fear.

01:12:06.600 --> 01:12:08.600
There's no this.

01:12:08.600 --> 01:12:10.600
But it's a very beautiful thing.

01:12:12.600 --> 01:12:14.600
I think we should continue next week.

01:12:14.600 --> 01:12:16.600
Because it's 11 o'clock.

01:12:16.600 --> 01:12:18.600
I want to finish it. But why should we finish it

01:12:18.600 --> 01:12:20.600
in Raja?

01:12:20.600 --> 01:12:22.600
You know,

01:12:22.600 --> 01:12:24.600
we're explaining the point.

01:12:24.600 --> 01:12:26.600
I'm sorry.

01:12:26.600 --> 01:12:28.600
The thing about the

01:12:28.600 --> 01:12:30.600
wine.

01:12:30.600 --> 01:12:32.600
Is that an expression about

01:12:32.600 --> 01:12:34.600
Aram Abba?

01:12:34.600 --> 01:12:36.600
That's a rabbinic expression.

01:12:36.600 --> 01:12:38.600
Yes.

01:12:38.600 --> 01:12:40.600
A metaphor.

01:12:40.600 --> 01:12:42.600
Even this metaphor.

01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:44.600
Since we talk about wine.

01:12:44.600 --> 01:12:46.600
It might be something to do with wine.

01:12:46.600 --> 01:12:48.600
Maybe something physical.

01:12:48.600 --> 01:12:50.600
Something that you could compare with

01:12:50.600 --> 01:12:52.600
drinking real wine.

01:12:52.600 --> 01:12:54.600
Don't compare it to real wine.

01:12:54.600 --> 01:12:56.600
And this metaphor,

01:12:56.600 --> 01:12:58.600
which is the most mundane metaphor we have

01:12:58.600 --> 01:13:00.600
for Aram Abba.

01:13:00.600 --> 01:13:02.600
No human being

01:13:02.600 --> 01:13:04.600
was ever to experience this.

01:13:04.600 --> 01:13:06.600
The Gohim is interesting.

01:13:06.600 --> 01:13:08.600
The Gohim

01:13:08.600 --> 01:13:10.600
identified pleasure

01:13:10.600 --> 01:13:12.600
with disorder.

01:13:14.600 --> 01:13:16.600
Interesting thing.

01:13:16.600 --> 01:13:18.600
I saw a movie. I like it. I didn't like it.

01:13:18.600 --> 01:13:20.600
I was conditioned against it.

01:13:20.600 --> 01:13:22.600
And Mrs. Dunfire.

01:13:22.600 --> 01:13:24.600
Dunfire. Dunfire.

01:13:24.600 --> 01:13:26.600
I don't like it.

01:13:26.600 --> 01:13:28.600
Saw it Bereshit. I don't like it.

01:13:28.600 --> 01:13:30.600
This guy

01:13:30.600 --> 01:13:32.600
wanted to celebrate the birthday of

01:13:32.600 --> 01:13:34.600
one of his children's birthday.

01:13:34.600 --> 01:13:36.600
What he does?

01:13:36.600 --> 01:13:38.600
He brings horses to the house.

01:13:38.600 --> 01:13:40.600
He associates

01:13:40.600 --> 01:13:42.600
pleasure

01:13:42.600 --> 01:13:44.600
with Horban.

01:13:44.600 --> 01:13:46.600
This woman. She's working the whole day

01:13:46.600 --> 01:13:48.600
in an office.

01:13:48.600 --> 01:13:50.600
She comes back and she sees a horse

01:13:50.600 --> 01:13:52.600
and a pony inside the thing.

01:13:52.600 --> 01:13:54.600
That's not the way to celebrate happiness.

01:13:54.600 --> 01:13:56.600
The whole notion

01:13:56.600 --> 01:13:58.600
that you celebrate happiness in a disorderly

01:13:58.600 --> 01:14:00.600
anarchic manner

01:14:00.600 --> 01:14:02.600
is stupid.

01:14:02.600 --> 01:14:04.600
So, you will think,

01:14:04.600 --> 01:14:06.600
I get drunk.

01:14:06.600 --> 01:14:08.600
What do you mean get drunk?

01:14:08.600 --> 01:14:10.600
Get drunk is a license to be disorderly

01:14:10.600 --> 01:14:12.600
and raucous

01:14:12.600 --> 01:14:14.600
and make all kind of

01:14:14.600 --> 01:14:16.600
noises and so on.

01:14:16.600 --> 01:14:18.600
That is not the way to enjoy happiness.

01:14:18.600 --> 01:14:20.600
Happiness is not disorder.

01:14:20.600 --> 01:14:22.600
Happiness is not drunkness.

01:14:22.600 --> 01:14:24.600
That's why I always say,

01:14:24.600 --> 01:14:26.600
don't think that this is

01:14:26.600 --> 01:14:28.600
means of how to get drunk

01:14:28.600 --> 01:14:30.600
but a little bit about Horban.

01:14:30.600 --> 01:14:32.600
No.

01:14:32.600 --> 01:14:34.600
You understand?

01:14:34.600 --> 01:14:36.600
That's it.

01:14:36.600 --> 01:14:38.600
My criticism of this is

01:14:38.600 --> 01:14:40.600
Doubtfire.

01:14:40.600 --> 01:14:42.600
The whole notion

01:14:42.600 --> 01:14:44.600
the whole notion

01:14:44.600 --> 01:14:46.600
that to be happy you have to be

01:14:46.600 --> 01:14:48.600
rude and brute

01:14:48.600 --> 01:14:50.600
and violent

01:14:50.600 --> 01:14:52.600
and noisy

01:14:52.600 --> 01:14:54.600
and destroy things. Why?

01:14:54.600 --> 01:14:56.600
Did you see the movie Alive?

01:14:56.600 --> 01:14:58.600
Yes.

01:14:58.600 --> 01:15:00.600
No, no.

01:15:00.600 --> 01:15:02.600
You are talking about the Chile

01:15:02.600 --> 01:15:04.600
with the mountains?

01:15:04.600 --> 01:15:06.600
No, no.

01:15:06.600 --> 01:15:08.600
This is about a man who

01:15:08.600 --> 01:15:10.600
survives a plane crash and saves

01:15:10.600 --> 01:15:12.600
hundreds of people.

01:15:12.600 --> 01:15:14.600
Because of him he saved a lot of people

01:15:14.600 --> 01:15:16.600
in the crash.

01:15:16.600 --> 01:15:18.600
No, I didn't see it.

01:15:18.600 --> 01:15:20.600
Something like that.

01:15:20.600 --> 01:15:22.600
Is it a true story?

01:15:22.600 --> 01:15:24.600
No.

01:15:24.600 --> 01:15:26.600
He could survive anything.

01:15:26.600 --> 01:15:28.600
And that's the

01:15:28.600 --> 01:15:30.600
common

01:15:30.600 --> 01:15:32.600
thing that happens to a person

01:15:32.600 --> 01:15:34.600
when he survives a fatal crash

01:15:34.600 --> 01:15:36.600
or a fatal airplane thing

01:15:36.600 --> 01:15:38.600
and they had all psychological

01:15:38.600 --> 01:15:40.600
psychological tests

01:15:40.600 --> 01:15:42.600
and this and...

01:15:42.600 --> 01:15:44.600
It's a nice movie?

01:15:44.600 --> 01:15:46.600
You read it?

01:15:46.600 --> 01:15:48.600
I read about it.

01:15:48.600 --> 01:15:50.600
It sounds very good.

01:15:50.600 --> 01:15:52.600
It was very, very, very good.

01:15:52.600 --> 01:15:54.600
But look into us.

01:15:54.600 --> 01:15:56.600
It's interesting. I said it many times

01:15:56.600 --> 01:15:58.600
in my Pesah

01:15:58.600 --> 01:16:00.600
in the cellar.

01:16:00.600 --> 01:16:02.600
We were slaves. Oppressed.

01:16:02.600 --> 01:16:04.600
Now we have freedom.

01:16:04.600 --> 01:16:06.600
Now, how

01:16:06.600 --> 01:16:08.600
do they go in to celebrate freedom?

01:16:08.600 --> 01:16:10.600
Violence.

01:16:10.600 --> 01:16:12.600
Parties are all violence.

01:16:12.600 --> 01:16:14.600
There are violent parties.

01:16:14.600 --> 01:16:16.600
New Year's Eve.

01:16:16.600 --> 01:16:18.600
Friday night and Saturday night they go in.

01:16:18.600 --> 01:16:20.600
They go to bars and they get drunk and they're violent.

01:16:20.600 --> 01:16:22.600
Halloween.

01:16:22.600 --> 01:16:24.600
All of it is violence.

01:16:24.600 --> 01:16:26.600
Carnival.

01:16:26.600 --> 01:16:28.600
Now,

01:16:28.600 --> 01:16:30.600
among Jews, we celebrate

01:16:30.600 --> 01:16:32.600
freedom

01:16:32.600 --> 01:16:34.600
with the word Seder. Seder means order.

01:16:34.600 --> 01:16:36.600
The opposite.

01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:38.600
Exactly.

01:16:38.600 --> 01:16:40.600
Happiness is found

01:16:40.600 --> 01:16:42.600
not in disorder but in order.

01:16:42.600 --> 01:16:44.600
Your wife,

01:16:44.600 --> 01:16:46.600
your children, your relatives,

01:16:46.600 --> 01:16:48.600
your friends.

01:16:48.600 --> 01:16:50.600
An orderly meal.

01:16:50.600 --> 01:16:52.600
Structure

01:16:52.600 --> 01:16:54.600
and for Pesah.

01:16:54.600 --> 01:16:56.600
This

01:16:56.600 --> 01:16:58.600
is the way. Do you think that

01:16:58.600 --> 01:17:00.600
you think that the person

01:17:00.600 --> 01:17:02.600
who is happy is the person, I don't know,

01:17:02.600 --> 01:17:04.600
the playboy who goes from

01:17:04.600 --> 01:17:06.600
this like Frank Sinatra is 80 years old

01:17:06.600 --> 01:17:08.600
still he's looking for the perfect girl.

01:17:08.600 --> 01:17:10.600
What do I mean?

01:17:10.600 --> 01:17:12.600
Should be a thought. 80 years old.

01:17:12.600 --> 01:17:14.600
Where is the perfect girl?

01:17:14.600 --> 01:17:16.600
The hero for me is not

01:17:16.600 --> 01:17:18.600
Frank Sinatra

01:17:18.600 --> 01:17:20.600
or whatever it is.

01:17:20.600 --> 01:17:22.600
It's the person who is

01:17:22.600 --> 01:17:24.600
happily married

01:17:24.600 --> 01:17:26.600
with his wife and children.

01:17:26.600 --> 01:17:28.600
This is the person who is happy.

01:17:28.600 --> 01:17:30.600
Not the playboys of the world.

01:17:30.600 --> 01:17:32.600
You know.

01:17:32.600 --> 01:17:34.600
Because all of it is disorder.

01:17:34.600 --> 01:17:36.600
Happiness in our concept

01:17:36.600 --> 01:17:38.600
is

01:17:38.600 --> 01:17:40.600
connected with order.

01:17:40.600 --> 01:17:42.600
This is the truth.

01:17:42.600 --> 01:17:44.600
Order.

01:17:44.600 --> 01:17:46.600
Order.

01:17:46.600 --> 01:17:48.600
All right?

01:17:48.600 --> 01:17:50.600
Yes.

01:17:52.600 --> 01:17:54.600
This is it.

01:17:56.600 --> 01:17:58.600
That's right.

01:18:00.600 --> 01:18:02.600
There is no two views.

01:18:02.600 --> 01:18:04.600
But even

01:18:04.600 --> 01:18:06.600
if you see carefully

01:18:06.600 --> 01:18:08.600
the disagreement is on the stages and so on.

01:18:08.600 --> 01:18:10.600
It doesn't

01:18:10.600 --> 01:18:12.600
you know.

01:18:12.600 --> 01:18:14.600
Sometimes he's wrong.

01:18:14.600 --> 01:18:16.600
He was wrong.

01:18:18.600 --> 01:18:20.600
Nobody says

01:18:20.600 --> 01:18:22.600
Rabbi Ha'an was God.

01:18:22.600 --> 01:18:24.600
There is no God.

01:18:24.600 --> 01:18:26.600
Rabbi Okanar

01:18:26.600 --> 01:18:28.600
received a different tradition?

01:18:28.600 --> 01:18:30.600
Maybe he misinterpreted the tradition or whatever it is.

01:18:32.600 --> 01:18:34.600
He wouldn't say

01:18:34.600 --> 01:18:36.600
that Hafez Shalom...

01:18:36.600 --> 01:18:38.600
It makes no difference.

01:18:38.600 --> 01:18:40.600
We have nobody

01:18:40.600 --> 01:18:42.600
and there is no God except God.

01:18:44.600 --> 01:18:46.600
According to Rabbi Okanar

01:18:46.600 --> 01:18:48.600
he said that there is no utopia in this world.

01:18:50.600 --> 01:18:52.600
Does that mean pre-Mashiah?

01:18:52.600 --> 01:18:54.600
Pre-Mashiah.

01:18:54.600 --> 01:18:56.600
Or post-Mashiah?

01:18:56.600 --> 01:18:58.600
I believe, like our Imam says it,

01:18:58.600 --> 01:19:00.600
there is going to be the Mashiah.

01:19:00.600 --> 01:19:02.600
And after the Mashiah is going to be

01:19:02.600 --> 01:19:04.600
Tahiyyat Ametim.

01:19:04.600 --> 01:19:06.600
And that is going to be a new...

01:19:06.600 --> 01:19:08.600
That's utopia.

01:19:08.600 --> 01:19:10.600
From our point of view.

01:19:10.600 --> 01:19:12.600
Now when Rabbam says, am I right?

01:19:12.600 --> 01:19:14.600
Rabbam says, when the Mashiah will come, we'll see.

01:19:14.600 --> 01:19:16.600
That's what Rabbam says.

01:19:16.600 --> 01:19:18.600
He says about himself.

01:19:22.600 --> 01:19:24.600
Who cares?

01:19:24.600 --> 01:19:26.600
Why should we fight?

01:19:26.600 --> 01:19:28.600
What the color of the Mashiah is going to be?

01:19:30.600 --> 01:19:32.600
The five...

01:19:32.600 --> 01:19:34.600
That's one.

01:19:34.600 --> 01:19:36.600
Two.

01:19:36.600 --> 01:19:38.600
Three. Four. Five.

01:19:38.600 --> 01:19:40.600
How did they get so many different...

01:19:40.600 --> 01:19:42.600
It's called conjecture.

01:19:42.600 --> 01:19:44.600
Conjecture.

01:19:44.600 --> 01:19:46.600
There is no sources for it.

01:19:46.600 --> 01:19:48.600
The sources?

01:19:48.600 --> 01:19:50.600
Rabbam would have called them cat.

01:19:50.600 --> 01:19:52.600
Because the last one...

01:19:56.600 --> 01:19:58.600
And this is cat.

01:19:58.600 --> 01:20:00.600
Cat.

01:20:00.600 --> 01:20:02.600
Taifi. Taifi.

01:20:02.600 --> 01:20:04.600
Taifi.

01:20:06.600 --> 01:20:08.600
Yes. Taifi.

01:20:16.600 --> 01:20:18.600
So everything is just conjecture.

01:20:18.600 --> 01:20:20.600
There is no conjecture.

01:20:20.600 --> 01:20:22.600
That's it.

01:20:22.600 --> 01:20:24.600
That's it.

01:20:24.600 --> 01:20:26.600
Mashiah...

01:20:26.600 --> 01:20:28.600
The description...

01:20:28.600 --> 01:20:30.600
This is it.

01:20:32.600 --> 01:20:34.600
This must be...

01:20:34.600 --> 01:20:36.600
What do you say?

01:20:36.600 --> 01:20:38.600
I know this comes from Tehillim.

01:20:38.600 --> 01:20:48.600
[inaudible]
